      "content": "<h3>Where stacks are used</h3>\n<p>LIFO order appears all over programming. Four classic jobs, each with a program:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Matching brackets</strong> in a compiler or editor.</li>\n<li><strong>Reversing</strong> a sequence.</li>\n<li><strong>Undo / Back</strong> history in applications and browsers.</li>\n<li><strong>Evaluating expressions</strong> (postfix notation) and the <strong>call stack</strong> of method calls, including recursion.</li>\n</ul>"
